## Interface: 120105, 120100, 50504, 38002, 20506, 16001, 11509
## Title: NPC Sonar
## Notes: Scans for NPCs by name, shows an icon over their nameplates, and gives you a one-click sonar badge that targets and marks them.
## Author: mmantas
## Version: 1.2.0
## SavedVariables: NpcSonarDB
## Category: Quests
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\NpcSonar\Media\sonar_search

# Core first: the other files call into it at runtime, and Core only calls
# their hooks (ns.SetStatus, ns.Refresh, ns.UpdateMarkButton,
# ns.UpdateIndicator) once something is scanning, by which point they have
# loaded. Style before the files that build widgets from it; MarkButton
# and Radar read ns.Style at file scope.
# Bindings.xml is picked up by the client automatically and is not listed.
Core.lua
Pin.lua
Lists.lua
Sightings.lua
Quests.lua
Style.lua
UI.lua
MarkButton.lua
Radar.lua
Launchers.lua
